<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay inflation falls to zero in October.</title>
<headline>Paraguay inflation falls to zero in October.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay inflation was 0.0 percent in October, down from 0.3 percent September and 0.8 percent in October 1995, the Central Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Accumulated inflation in the first 10 months of the year was 7.5 percent, down from the 10.9 percent in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>Twelve-month inflation to the end of October was 8.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom, 595 21 444527/8</p>
</text>
